# Copy this file as base_url.txt and enter your API gateway/endpoint URL.
#   cp base_url.txt.example base_url.txt
# The gateway should be OpenAI-compatible, usually pointing up to /v1,
# and Jarvis will automatically append /chat/completions. Or connect directly:
#   https://api.deepseek.com/v1
# The environment variable JARVIS_BASE_URL has higher priority.
https://your-api-gateway-url/v1
